Subject: [PATCH] feat(swarmagents): list pending approvals + DELETE cancel
 (task_mwmdm11r_gihy)

GET /api/runtime/approvals returns the caller's pending approvals so a
reconnecting tab can rehydrate approval cards whose SSE event it missed.
DELETE /api/runtime/approvals/{id} cancels a pending approval, recorded as a
denial so the paused run stops instead of waiting out the TTL.

Adds ApprovalStore.listPending(userId?) and route tests for both verbs.
